<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 1: </span>Performance of varying deep research agents on DeepResearch Bench, DeepConsult, and DeepResearchGym. The results on DeepResearch Bench are taken from the official leaderboard. Our proposed WebWeaver achieves state-of-the-art performance.</figcaption>
